s shorter than 2048 bits and can be factored with practical effort. Use at least 3072 bits (2048 is the minimum accepted today).\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.security.cryptography.rsa.create](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.security.cryptography.rsa.create)\n","text":"The RSA key is shorter than 2048 bits and can be factored with practical effort. Use at least 3072 bits (2048 is the minimum accepted today)."},"id":"opt.pathos.rules.pathos.crypto.csharp.small-rsa-key","name":"opt.pathos.rules.pathos.crypto.csharp.small-rsa-key","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-326: Inadequate Encryption Strength","HIGH CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Opengrep Finding: opt.pathos.rules.pathos.crypto.csharp.small-rsa-key"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"The IV is a constant. Reusing an IV with the same key reveals relations between messages. Let the algorithm generate a random IV (GenerateIV) for every message and store it with the ciphertext."},"help":{"markdown":"The IV is a constant. Reusing an IV with the same key reveals relations between messages. Let the algorithm generate a random IV (GenerateIV) for every message and store it with the ciphertext.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.security.cryptography.symmetricalgorithm.iv](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.security.cryptography.symmetricalgorithm.iv)\n","text":"The IV is a constant. Reusing an IV with the same key reveals relations between messages. Let the algorithm generate a random IV (GenerateIV) for every message and store it with the ciphertext."},"id":"opt.pathos.rules.pathos.crypto.csharp.static-iv","name":"opt.pathos.rules.pathos.crypto.csharp.static-iv","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-329: Generation of Predictable IV with CBC Mode","HIGH CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":